# Notation: one exception handler for two protected actions (UML 2.5.1, 15.5) inside an expansion region.
# Checking and charging the card throw different exceptions, the same handler action takes both. Its exception pins
# stand on the left below each other, each at the height of its protected action; the handler grows for them. The
# keyword of the region stays in its corner, the name stands right of the edge going inside, for lack of room left.
diagram activity "Karten belasten" subtitle="Gemeinsamer Handler mit Seiten-Pins, Name des Bereichs neben der Kante" locale=de

partition shop "Onlineshop"
partition zahlung "Zahlungsdienst"

expansion je "Jede hinterlegte Karte nacheinander versuchen" mode=iterative

initial start in shop
action laden "Karten laden" in shop output="Karten"
action pruefen "Karte prüfen" in zahlung expansion=je input="Karte"
action belasten "Karte belasten" in zahlung expansion=je
object beleg "Beleg" in zahlung expansion=je
action fehler "Fehler vermerken" in zahlung expansion=je
action buchen "Zahlung verbuchen" in shop input="Belege"
final ende in shop

go start -> laden
go laden => je
go je => pruefen
go pruefen -> belasten
go belasten => beleg
go beleg => je
go je => buchen
go buchen -> ende

handler pruefen -> fehler "Karte ungültig"
handler belasten -> fehler "Limit erreicht"
